  "abstract": "<jats:p>We review electro-optic equalizer-integrated thin-film lithium-niobate modulators enabling bandwidths beyond 100 GHz with a low half-wave voltage. This design mitigates the efficiency–bandwidth trade-off, supporting ultra-high-baud-rate optical transmission beyond 200 GBaud.</jats:p>",
